 Disney, and Warner Bros. Discovery. This project is non-commercial and created for educational purposes only."],"features":["Dual Universe Coverage — Full Marvel and DC sections, each with dedicated universe hub pages","Hero Profiles — 24 individual hero detail pages with origins, powers & abilities, creators, first appearances, and 3-image galleries","Team Profiles — 18 team pages featuring clickable team member icon grids, first appearances, team overviews, and powers","Upcoming Movies & TV Series — Release dates, synopsis, trailers, and image galleries for upcoming titles across both universes","Universe Hub Pages — Dedicated Marvel and DC pages aggregating heroes, teams, and upcoming content per universe"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jega1312/heroverse/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"3ac62b851e50c349d39cdac0a33c53981e6be2c0ba4822af0cb2f1a63243b2e8","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:38.708Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:38.708Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A fan-made multi-page information hub website dedicated to the Marvel and DC universes. Built as a frontend portfolio project to demonstrate real-world HTML, Sass/SCSS, JavaScript, and Bootstrap 5 skills across a large-scale multi-page architecture.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jega1312/heroverse/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"3ac62b851e50c349d39cdac0a33c53981e6be2c0ba4822af0cb2f1a63243b2e8","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jega1312/heroverse/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:38.709Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-02T13:13:48Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jega1312/heroverse/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T15:46:38.710Z","hash":"3ac62b851e50c349d39cdac0a33c53981e6be2c0ba4822af0cb2f1a63243b2e8","originalBytes":19522,"storedBytes":19522,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["images","gallery","marvel","pages","upcoming","heroes","hero","teams","team","icon